    "title": "BIP375: validate PSBT_OUT_SP_V0_LABEL length",
    "user": {
      "login": "wangjingshuiku",
      "id": 245502474,
      "node_id": "U_kgDODqISCg",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245502474?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/wangjingshuiku",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/wangjingshuiku/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "\r\nThis PR updates the BIP-375 reference validator to enforce the serialized length of PSBT_OUT_SP_V0_LABEL.\r\n\r\nBIP-375 defines the field value as a 32-bit little-endian unsigned integer, so PSBT_OUT_SP_V0_LABEL must contain exactly 4 bytes. Previously, the validator only checked that PSBT_OUT_SP_V0_LABEL requires PSBT_OUT_SP_V0_INFO, allowing malformed values such as a one-byte label when valid SP_V0_INFO was present.\r\n\r\n",
